If your model is relatively straightforward, this means that the models are not the same.

When you  add std.lv <http://std.lv> = TRUE, you  are adding an additional constraint, you  need to relax a constraint somewhere else to keep the models the same. Do your  two models have the same degrees of freedom?

Jeremy

